board: olimex: mx23_olinuxino: mux hub power pin to GPIO

board_ehci_hcd_init() drives GPIO0_17 to power the LAN9512/GL850G USB
hub, but never muxed the GPMI_ALE pad to its GPIO function. Do that
explicitly, as Linux does for its usb0_vbus regulator, and give the hub
a little longer to power up.

--- a/board/olimex/mx23_olinuxino/mx23_olinuxino.c
+++ b/board/olimex/mx23_olinuxino/mx23_olinuxino.c
@@ -39,8 +39,9 @@
 int board_ehci_hcd_init(int port)
 {
 	/* Enable LAN9512 (Maxi) or GL850G (Mini) USB HUB power. */
+	mxs_iomux_setup_pad(MX23_PAD_GPMI_ALE__GPIO_0_17);
 	gpio_direction_output(MX23_PAD_GPMI_ALE__GPIO_0_17, 1);
-	udelay(100);
+	udelay(1000);
 	return 0;
 }
 
